@startuml b-class-06-alerts
title 食序 FoodFlow｜效期與低庫存預警領域類別圖
caption FR-12～FR-14｜局部視圖，完整關聯見原始總覽圖
left to right direction
hide circle
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft JhengHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBorderColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 100
skinparam padding 6
skinparam dpi 120

class "員工\nEmployee" as Employee <<entity>> #F2EFF8 {
  +id : int
  +username : str
  +password_hash : str
  +name : str
  +role : EmployeeRole
  +is_active : bool
  +token_version : int
  +created_at : datetime
}

class "預警設定\nAlertSetting" as AlertSetting <<entity>> #F2EFF8 {
  +id : int
  +name : str
  +warning_days : int
  +created_at : datetime
  +updated_at : datetime
  +updated_by_id : int | None
}

class "食材\nIngredient" as Ingredient <<entity>> #EFF6FF {
  +id : int
  +name : str
  +category_id : int
  +unit : str
  +storage_method : StorageType
  +safety_stock_quantity : Decimal
  +is_active : bool
  +created_at : datetime
}

class "庫存批次\nInventoryBatch" as InventoryBatch <<entity>> #FFF7ED {
  +id : int
  +batch_number : str
  +source_item_id : int
  +ingredient_id : int
  +expiry_date : date
  +received_date : date
  +current_location_id : int
  +unit_price : Decimal | None
  +initial_quantity : Decimal
  +remaining_quantity : Decimal
}

Employee "0..1" -- "0..*" AlertSetting : updated_by
Ingredient "1" -- "0..*" InventoryBatch : ingredient
AlertSetting -[hidden]right-> Ingredient


legend bottom left
  預警由設定、食材安全庫存量與批次效期計算。
  AlertSetting 與 Ingredient／InventoryBatch
  沒有直接資料關聯，不以虛構連線表示計算依賴。
  ─────────────────────
  + 公開屬性；/ 衍生唯讀屬性；T | None 可為空
  端點數字為原圖多重度；交叉處不代表關聯或分支
  共用類別可出現在不同模組圖；屬性均完整保留
endlegend
@enduml
